<title>RUSSIA: Rouble firms ahead of T-bill auction.</title>
<headline>Rouble firms ahead of T-bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble firmed slightly on Monday as banks started selling dollars for Wednesday's Treasury bill auctions, dealers said.</p>
<p>   roubles/dollar     Jan 27 midday  Jan 27 early  Jan 24 close</p>
<p>   today settlement   5,617/19	 5,622/23	5,622-23</p>
<p>   tomorrow settlement5,621/23	 5,622/24	5,622-23</p>
<p>   overnight credit (%)  21-26	    14-20	    4-8</p>
<p>			     Jan 27			     Jan 24</p>
<p>   central bank	 5,616/26			   5,613/23</p>
<p>   MICEX		  5,620				5,618</p>
<p>&quot;Roubles have became more expensive, there is a shortage of them on the market,&quot; said Andrei Tenyatov, chief expert at Most</p>
</text>
